          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Tengai Makyou: Daiyon no Mokushiroku, also known as Far East of Eden: The Apocalypse IV, is a 1997 RPG for the Sega Saturn released in Japan by Hudson Soft. It is spin-off of Hudson and Red's Tengai Makyou (Far East of Eden) series.\n\nFor many years this game was a Sega Saturn exclusive, however was remade in 2006 for the PlayStation Portable.",
